  "terms_intro": "These terms cover using REHLA to discover, plan and book outings. By booking, you agree to them.",
  "terms_1_title": "Who runs your outing",
  "terms_1_body": "REHLA lists outings run by independent local operators. The operator named on each outing runs it and is responsible for it on the day.",
  "terms_2_title": "Holds, payment and confirmation",
  "terms_2_body": "When you book, we hold your place for a short time while you pay. Paid isn't the same as confirmed: the operator confirms your booking, and you'll see its status change in Trip.",
  "terms_3_title": "Prices",
  "terms_3_body": "Prices are in Egyptian pounds and cover what each outing lists as included. Anything not listed isn't included.",
  "terms_4_title": "Cancellations and refunds",
  "terms_4_body": "Each outing shows its cancellation terms before you pay, such as free cancellation up to 24 hours before. Refunds follow those terms and go back to your original payment method.",
  "terms_5_title": "Wind, sea and safety",
  "terms_5_body": "Sea and desert outings depend on conditions. If conditions make an outing unsafe, the operator may move or cancel it. Follow your guide's instructions, and bring any certification an outing asks for.",
  "terms_6_title": "DayGi suggestions",
  "terms_6_body": "DayGi is an AI guide. Its suggestions are a starting point — check times, prices and conditions on the outing before you book.",
  "terms_7_title": "Your account",
  "terms_7_body": "Keep your sign-in details private. You're responsible for bookings made from your account.",
  "privacy_intro": "We collect only what we need to plan and run your trip.",
  "privacy_1_title": "What we keep",
  "privacy_1_body": "Your name, email or phone, your trips and bookings, and the messages you send to DayGi or our team.",
  "privacy_2_title": "Who sees it",
  "privacy_2_body": "The operator of an outing you book sees your name, phone and booking details so they can meet you. We don't sell your data.",
  "privacy_3_title": "On this phone",
  "privacy_3_body": "Your sign-in session, language and appearance are stored on this device. Your latest trip is saved here too, so your voucher opens without a connection.",
  "privacy_4_title": "Location",
  "privacy_4_body": "The app doesn't track your location. Maps show places, not you.",
  "privacy_5_title": "Diagnostics",
  "privacy_5_body": "We use Firebase to count app usage and report crashes so we can fix problems. These reports don't include your messages or payment details.",
  "privacy_6_title": "Payments",
  "privacy_6_body": "Card payments are handled by our payment provider. We never see or store your full card number.",
